{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/azizi-farishta-jebel-ali-village","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":426,"crm_id":"1717","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Azizi Farishta","slug":"azizi-farishta-jebel-ali-village","display_address":"Jebel Ali","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":1685000,"display_price":"1.68M","lattitude":25.0242014,"longitude":55.1366081,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Azizi Farishta is a mixed-use development located in Al Furjan neighborhood, Dubai. It is a project of Azizi Developments. The complex features serviced apartments and commercial space. The 15-storey building has a total of 292 residential units, including 137 studios, 124 one-bedroom apartments, 23 two-bedroom apartments and 8 two-storey penthouses with beautiful city views.</p><p>The apartments are offered with modern furnishings and all necessary appliances. The penthouses located in Azizi Farishta have balconies, private pools, gyms, as well as saunas and other recreational facilities.</p><p>Azizi Farishta offers to all residents: health club, playground, large parking lot, swimming pools for adults and children, outdoor pool bar, 24-hour security and video surveillance.<br>In addition, all living areas are connected to centralized air conditioning systems. Concierge services are available at any time of the day.</p><p>In the building itself there are stores where you can buy groceries and basic necessities.</p><p>The complex is located next to the major highway Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. This ensures its excellent transportation accessibility even from the outlying communities of the city.<br>Residents of Azizi Farishta can reach Burj Al Arab in 21 minutes, Dubai International Airport and Al Maktoum International Airport in 30 minutes, Mall of the Emirates in 19 minutes and Palm Jumeirah in 16 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1717/images/2024/04/24/6e5L9VnFxb6I7e32vKZlHJBGnW9t93dnGtX4MMLQ.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/6e5L9VnFxb6I7e32vKZlHJBGnW9t93dnGtX4MMLQ.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1717/images/2024/04/24/6in9yeoI6t8hcRbnUmGa2FLLRWBIytBbg5xUooLV.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/6in9yeoI6t8hcRbnUmGa2FLLRWBIytBbg5xUooLV.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1717/images/2024/04/24/UBGlJnm45d2aHr3Hl24l69nAW7jkv5yZdxe6VHA5.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/UBGlJnm45d2aHr3Hl24l69nAW7jkv5yZdxe6VHA5.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2100,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1347,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6697,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6698,"title":"80%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Jebel Ali","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11622,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11623,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11624,"url":null,"text":"Children’s pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11625,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11626,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11627,"url":null,"text":"Broadband Internet","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11628,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11629,"url":null,"text":"Central A/C","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11630,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","t